  "question": {
    "text": "The given figure shows the elliptical orbit of a planet <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;about the sun <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>.&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is the time taken by the planet to move from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is the time taken by the planet to move from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>, then the relation between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math><sub>&nbsp;</sub>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is [Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>]<br />\r<br />\r&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0017141_Question_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 126px;\" />",
